3.2. In-vehicle AR-HUD HMI features
The article by Betancur et al. (2018) provides an overview of research topics and implementation trends related to automotive HUD systems. The authors note that HUDs have the potential to enhance driver safety and comfort by providing important information without the need for drivers to take their eyes off the road. The article discusses various types of HUDs, including combiner-type, windshield-type, and spatial augmented reality HUDs. It highlights the importance of considering factors such as display location,
